</svg></div><div class="text-block-9">Zaustavi audio</div></a></div></div></div><div data-hero-variant="mobile" class="heroheader05_image-wrapper mobile-view-image margin-bottom margin-medium"><div class="image-group"><img fetchpriority="low" decoding="async" data-src="/assets/images/final/t2.png" src="data:image/gif;base64,R0lGODlhAQABAIAAAAAAAP///ywAAAAAAQABAAACAUwAOw==" loading="lazy" height="" sizes="(max-width: 479px) 100vw, (max-width: 767px) 85vw, (max-width: 991px) 540px, 100vw" alt="Abak - antički kalkulator" data-srcset="/assets/images/final/t2-p-500.png 500w, /assets/images/final/t2-p-800.png 800w, /assets/images/final/t2.png 878w" class="heroheader05_image hidden-image-background"/><img fetchpriority="low" decoding="async" data-src="/assets/images/final/pozadina-20za-20sliku.svg" src="data:image/gif;base64,R0lGODlhAQABAIAAAAAAAP///ywAAAAAAQABAAACAUwAOw==" loading="lazy" alt="image background" class="image-background image-background-opacity"/><div class="w-layout-hflex ar-and-copyright"><img fetchpriority="low" decoding="async" data-src="/assets/images/final/ar-20ikona-20-20s.png" src="data:image/gif;base64,R0lGODlhAQABAIAAAAAAAP///ywAAAAAAQABAAACAUwAOw==" loading="lazy" alt="irene stvarnosti" class="image-2"/><div class="text-copyright-or-title">Tradicionalni kineski abacus</div></div></div><div class="qr-and-instructions tablet"><div class="qr-container"><img fetchpriority="low" decoding="async" data-src="/assets/images/final/image.png" src="data:image/gif;base64,R0lGODlhAQABAIAAAAAAAP///ywAAAAAAQABAAACAUwAOw==" loading="lazy" alt="QR kod za AR iskustvo proširene stvarnosti" class="image qr"/><div class="text-block-3">Skeniraj kod mobitelom i uperi kameru u sliku da pokreneš AR.</div></div></div></div><div class="text-size-large-2">Iako se još od kraja 19. stoljeća pokušavalo napraviti kvalitetne kalkulatore na električni pogon, zbog nedovoljno razvijene tehnologije, ti kalkulatori su bili glomazni, teški i trošili su enormne količine struje jer su za rad trebali vruću katodu, koja je usput zagrijavala i ostatak mehanizma kojeg je pak trebalo hladiti da bi mogao ispravno raditi. <br/><br/>Prvim kalkulatorom s elektromotorom smatra se Autarith kojeg je 1902. konstruirao Alexander Rechnitzer.</div><div class="qr-and-instructions"><div class="qr-container"><img src="/assets/images/final/image.png" loading="lazy" alt="QR kod za AR iskustvo proširene stvarnosti" class="image qr"/><div class="text-block-3">Skeniraj kod mobitelom i uperi kameru u sliku da pokreneš AR.</div></div></div></div><div data-hero-variant="desktop" class="heroheader05_image-wrapper"><div class="image-group"><img fetchpriority="low" decoding="async" data-src="/assets/images/final/t2.png" src="data:image/gif;base64,R0lGODlhAQABAIAAAAAAAP///ywAAAAAAQABAAACAUwAOw==" loading="lazy" height="" sizes="(max-width: 991px) 100vw, 31vw" alt="Elektromehanički stroj" data-srcset="/assets/images/final/t2-p-500.png 500w, /assets/images/final/t2-p-800.png 800w, /assets/images/final/t2.png 878w" class="heroheader05_image hero-image-size"/><img fetchpriority="low" decoding="async" data-src="/assets/images/final/pozadina-20za-20sliku.svg" src="data:image/gif;base64,R0lGODlhAQABAIAAAAAAAP///ywAAAAAAQABAAACAUwAOw==" loading="lazy" alt="image background" class="image-background image-background-opacity"/><div class="w-layout-hflex ar-and-copyright"><img fetchpriority="low" decoding="async" data-src="/assets/images/final/ar-20ikona-20-20s.png" src="data:image/gif;base64,R0lGODlhAQABAIAAAAAAAP///ywAAAAAAQABAAACAUwAOw==" loading="lazy" alt="irene stvarnosti" class="image-2"/><div class="text-copyright-or-title">Tradicionalni kineski abacus</div></div></div><div class="qr-and-instructions tablet"><div class="qr-container"><img fetchpriority="low" decoding="async" data-src="/assets/images/final/image.png" src="data:image/gif;base64,R0lGODlhAQABAIAAAAAAAP///ywAAAAAAQABAAACAUwAOw==" loading="lazy" alt="QR kod za AR iskustvo proširene stvarnosti" class="image qr"/><div class="text-block-3">Skeniraj kod mobitelom i uperi kameru u sliku da pokreneš AR.</div></div></div></div></div></div></div></div></header><section class="section_layout58"><div class="page-padding"><div class="container-large-2"><div class="padding-vertical padding-xhuge"><div class="w-layout-grid layout58_component"><div class="layout58_image-wrapper mobile-view-hidden"><div class="featured-image-group"><img src="/assets/images/final/pozadina-20za-20sliku.svg" loading="lazy" alt="image background" width="753" class="featured-image-background-left"/><img src="/assets/images/final/silni-20kilovati.png" loading="lazy" srcset="/assets/images/final/silni-20kilovati-p-500.png 500w, /assets/images/final/silni-20kilovati.png 526w" alt="Dashboard mockup" sizes="(max-width: 991px) 100vw, 31vw" class="featured-image"/></div></div><div id="w-node-_57c6a1a9-a8ef-d9af-7053-a9e3dc6cf82a-9005e70c" class="layout58_content"><div class="margin-bottom margin-xsmall"><h3 class="heading-medium">Silni kilovati<br/></h3></div><div class="layout58_image-wrapper mobile-view-image"><div class="featured-image-group"><img src="/assets/images/final/pozadina-20za-20sliku.svg" loading="lazy" alt="image background" width="753" class="featured-image-background-left"/><img src="/assets/images/final/silni-20kilovati.png" loading="lazy" srcset="/assets/images/final/silni-20kilovati-p-500.png 500w, /assets/images/final/silni-20kilovati.png 526w" alt="Dashboard mockup" sizes="(max-width: 479px) 77vw, (max-width: 767px) 72vw, (max-width: 991px) 69vw, 100vw" class="featured-image"/></div></div><div class="text-size-large-2">Koliko puno su struje trošili ti prvi elektromehanički kalkulatori najbolje opisuje primjer ENIAC-a iz 1946. koji je trošio oko 150 kilovata struje, a obavljao je samo četiri osnovne računske operacije.<br/><br/>Danas moderni kalkulator koji obavlja sve moguće matematičke operacije troši manje od pola milivata, što je tristo milijuna puta manje.</div><div class="margin-top margin-medium"><div class="button-row-2 is-reverse-mobile-landscape"><div class="button-wrapper-3 max-width-full-mobile-landscape"><a href="#" class="button-secondary-gray w-inline-block"><div>Get started</div></a></div><div class="button-wrapper-3 max-width-full-mobile-landscape"><a href="#" class="uui-button w-inline-block"><div>Learn more</div></a></div></div></div></div></div></div></div></div></section><section class="section_layout58"><div class="page-padding"><div class="container-large-2"><div class="padding-vertical padding-xhuge"><div class="w-layout-grid layout58_component image-right"><div id="w-node-_57c6a1a9-a8ef-d9af-7053-a9e3dc6cf846-9005e70c" class="layout58_content"><div class="margin-bottom margin-xsmall"><h3 class="heading-medium">Casio 14-A<br/></h3></div><div class="layout58_image-wrapper mobile-view-image"><div class="featured-image-group"><img src="/assets/images/final/pozadina-20za-20sliku.svg" loading="lazy" alt="image background" width="753" class="featured-image-background-left"/><img src="/assets/images/final/casio_14-a_calculator_-_national_museum_of_nature_and_science-2c_tokyo_-_dsc07314-201.png" loading="lazy" srcset="/assets/images/final/casio_14-a_calculator_-_national_museum_of_nature_and_science-2c_tokyo_-_dsc07314-201-p-500.png 500w, /assets/images/final/casio_14-a_calculator_-_national_museum_of_nature_and_science-2c_tokyo_-_dsc07314-201.png 526w" alt="Casio_14-A_calculator_-_National_Museum_of_Nature_and_Science,_Tokyo" sizes="(max-width: 479px) 77vw, (max-width: 767px) 72vw, (max-width: 991px) 69vw, 100vw" class="featured-image"/></div></div><div class="text-size-large-2">Japanska tvrtka Casio Computer Company pustila je 1957. na tržište model Casio 14-A koji se smatra prvim gotovo potpuno električnim kompaktnim kalkulatorom na svijetu. <br/><br/>Bio je veličine stola i težio je, vrlo nepraktičnih, 140 kilograma. Broj 14 u nazivu označava da je imao kapacitet od 14 znamenki.</div><div class="margin-top margin-medium"><div class="button-row-2 is-reverse-mobile-landscape"><div class="button-wrapper-3 max-width-full-mobile-landscape"><a href="#" class="button-secondary-gray w-inline-block"><div>Get started</div></a></div><div class="button-wrapper-3 max-width-full-mobile-landscape"><a href="#" class="uui-button w-inline-block"><div>Learn more</div></a></div></div></div></div><div class="layout58_image-wrapper mobile-view-hidden"><div class="featured-image-group"><img src="/assets/images/final/pozadina-20za-20sliku.svg" loading="lazy" alt="image background" width="753" class="featured-image-background-left"/><img src="/assets/images/final/casio_14-a_calculator_-_national_museum_of_nature_and_science-2c_tokyo_-_dsc07314-201.png" loading="lazy" srcset="/assets/images/final/casio_14-a_calculator_-_national_museum_of_nature_and_science-2c_tokyo_-_dsc07314-201-p-500.png 500w, /assets/images/final/casio_14-a_calculator_-_national_museum_of_nature_and_science-2c_tokyo_-_dsc07314-201.png 526w" alt="Casio_14-A_calculator_-_National_Museum_of_Nature_and_Science,_Tokyo" sizes="(max-width: 991px) 100vw, 33vw" class="featured-image"/></div></div></div></div></div></div></section><section class="section_layout58"><div class="page-padding"><div class="container-large-2"><div class="padding-vertical padding-xhuge"><div class="w-layout-grid layout58_component"><div class="layout58_image-wrapper mobile-view-hidden"><div class="featured-image-group"><img src="/assets/images/final/pozadina-20za-20sliku.svg" loading="lazy" alt="image background" width="753" class="featured-image-background-left image-opacity"/><img src="/assets/images/final/anitamk8-01-20-20by-20maltagc-2c-20cc-20by-sa-203.0-2c-20https-__commons.wikimedia.org_w_index-202.png" loading="lazy" sizes="(max-width: 991px) 100vw, 31vw" width="263" alt="AnitaMk8-01 - by MaltaGC" srcset="/assets/images/final/anitamk8-01-20-20by-20maltagc-2c-20cc-20by-sa-203.0-2c-20https-__commons.wikimedia.org_w_index-202-p-500.png 500w, /assets/images/final/anitamk8-01-20-20by-20maltagc-2c-20cc-20by-sa-203.0-2c-20https-__commons.wikimedia.org_w_index-202.png 526w" class="featured-image"/></div></div><div id="w-node-_57c6a1a9-a8ef-d9af-7053-a9e3dc6cf867-9005e70c" class="layout58_content mobile-view-image"><div class="margin-bottom margin-xsmall"><h3 class="heading-medium">&quot;Samo&quot; 15 kilograma<br/></h3></div><div class="layout58_image-wrapper mobile-view-image"><div class="featured-image-group"><img src="/assets/images/final/pozadina-20za-20sliku.svg" loading="lazy" alt="image background" width="753" class="featured-image-background-left image-opacity"/><img src="/assets/images/final/anitamk8-01-20-20by-20maltagc-2c-20cc-20by-sa-203.0-2c-20https-__commons.wikimedia.org_w_index-202.png" loading="lazy" sizes="(max-width: 479px) 100vw, (max-width: 767px) 94vw, (max-width: 991px) 600px, 100vw" width="263" alt="AnitaMk8-01 - by MaltaGC" srcset="/assets/images/final/anitamk8-01-20-20by-20maltagc-2c-20cc-20by-sa-203.0-2c-20https-__commons.wikimedia.org_w_index-202-p-500.png 500w, /assets/images/final/anitamk8-01-20-20by-20maltagc-2c-20cc-20by-sa-203.0-2c-20https-__commons.wikimedia.org_w_index-202.png 526w" class="featured-image image-size-no-background"/></div></div><div class="text-size-large-2">Prvi sasvim elektronički stolni kalkulator na svijetu napravila je Britanska tvrtka Bell Punch/Sumlock 1961. godine. Zvao se ANITA (A New Inspiration To Arithmetic/Accounting). <br/><br/>Model Mark VII prodavao se u Europi, a model Mark VIII u Britaniji i ostatku svijeta. Velika prednost koju je nad konkurencijom imala ANITA je tih rad i težina od &quot;samo&quot; 15 kilograma.</div><div class="margin-top margin-medium"><div class="button-row-2 is-reverse-mobile-landscape"><div class="button-wrapper-3 max-width-full-mobile-landscape"><a href="#" class="button-secondary-gray w-inline-block"><div>Get started</div></a></div><div class="button-wrapper-3 max-width-full-mobile-landscape"><a href="#" class="uui-button w-inline-block"><div>Learn more</div></a></div></div></div></div></div></div></div></div></section>